(7613144, 1232078, 50641, '<td valign="top">Winter squash trellis? I had netting like that for a volunteer I thought was a spaghetti squash, but it turned into a pumpkin! No ball, no slipper, no coach. And no pumpkin seeds either.</td>', 'Winter squash trellis? I had netting like that for a volunteer I thought was a spaghetti squash, but it turned into a pumpkin! No ball, no slipper, no coach. And no pumpkin seeds either.', '2019-02-11 01:08:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(7613154, 1232038, 123833, '<td valign="top">I have to say that I don''t miss Australian flies!! They are so persistent, in the north I had to wear a full veil to be able to stay outdoors. We crossed Simpson Desert years ago and camped in the middle of it, 400km away from any kind of civilization. When we got out of the car we thought OMG, finally no flies!! BUT 10 minutes later the first one arrived followed by others! They flew 400km to annoy us!! ;)<br/> <br/>Anyway, fantastic image, Roz :) Congrats on HM.</td>', 'I have to say that I don''t miss Australian flies!! They are so persistent, in the north I had to wear a full veil to be able to stay outdoors. We crossed Simpson Desert years ago and camped in the middle of it, 400km away from any kind of civilization. When we got out of the car we thought OMG, finally no flies!! BUT 10 minutes later the first one arrived followed by others! They flew 400km to annoy us!! ;) Anyway, fantastic image, Roz :) Congrats on HM.', '2019-02-11 02:11:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(7613186, 1231686, 114285, '<td valign="top"><i><b>Sorry!! Each January we rent for 3 weeks the same holiday apartment in Zermatt with this view from the balcony, this challenge started when we were there. This year was the first time when we did not need to drive 800km to get there!!<br/> <br/>For the rest of the year since February 2018 we live in an apartment that has this view from the balcony:<br/>Waves of Lake Geneva<br/> <br/>Again, sorry, but renting enabled us to do this and I love skiing and the snow covered mountains!! </b></i> <br/> <br/>WOW seriously good timing Margaret. Anyway I watched your time lapse video, and my son walked by and said "why are you listening to Moonlight Sonata" I said "it''s a DPC photographer''s video from Switzerland" I then replied "that you were a lucky X-Aussie who moved over to Switzerland", and to which he then replied "well what''s stopping you" and so the seed has been planted :)<br/> <br/>Thanks for the video that was Brilliant, never tried that before, but it truly engulfed me.</td>', 'Sorry!! Each January we rent for 3 weeks the same holiday apartment in Zermatt with this view from the balcony, this challenge started when we were there. This year was the first time when we did not need to drive 800km to get there!! For the rest of the year since February 2018 we live in an apartment that has this view from the balcony:Waves of Lake Geneva Again, sorry, but renting enabled us to do this and I love skiing and the snow covered mountains!!   WOW seriously good timing Margaret. Anyway I watched your time lapse video, and my son walked by and said "why are you listening to Moonlight Sonata" I said "it''s a DPC photographer''s video from Switzerland" I then replied "that you were a lucky X-Aussie who moved over to Switzerland", and to which he then replied "well what''s stopping you" and so the seed has been planted :) Thanks for the video that was Brilliant, never tried that before, but it truly engulfed me.', '2019-02-11 04:02:21.000000', NULL, 0),
(7613191, 1231686, 123833, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Neat:</b></div><hr/><i> <br/>WOW seriously good timing Margaret. Anyway I watched your time lapse video, and my son walked by and said "why are you listening to Moonlight Sonata" I said "it''s a DPC photographer''s video from Switzerland" I then replied "that you were a lucky X-Aussie who moved over to Switzerland", and to which he then replied "well what''s stopping you" and so the seed has been planted :)<br/> <br/>Thanks for the video that was Brilliant, never tried that before, but it truly engulfed me. </i></td></tr></table> <br/>I assume that you can speak Italian so you could live in Swiss canton of Ticino!</td>', 'Originally posted by Neat: WOW seriously good timing Margaret. Anyway I watched your time lapse video, and my son walked by and said "why are you listening to Moonlight Sonata" I said "it''s a DPC photographer''s video from Switzerland" I then replied "that you were a lucky X-Aussie who moved over to Switzerland", and to which he then replied "well what''s stopping you" and so the seed has been planted :) Thanks for the video that was Brilliant, never tried that before, but it truly engulfed me.  I assume that you can speak Italian so you could live in Swiss canton of Ticino!', '2019-02-11 04:52:36.000000', NULL, 0),
