(7613266, 1232047, 114285, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by posthumous:</b></div><hr/><i> Beautiful rain. It would be nice to know your shutter speed. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Thanks Don. Shutter speed was 1/1600. I worked out when shooting in the rain to have it over 1/1000 that way the rain is more defined.</td>', 'Originally posted by posthumous: Beautiful rain. It would be nice to know your shutter speed.   Thanks Don. Shutter speed was 1/1600. I worked out when shooting in the rain to have it over 1/1000 that way the rain is more defined.', '2019-02-11 18:59:16.000000', NULL, 0),
